000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.
000400     TRELRCVR.
000500 AUTHOR.
000600     KURT MOVSESIAN.
000800
000900**************************************************************
001000*                                                            *
001100*D  T R E L R C V R    THIS PROGRAMS PLACES ALL THE ENTRIES  *
001200*D    IN 'RELFILE' BACK IN THE DATA SET 'DSHIPREL'. THIS     *
001300*D    PROGRAN IS USED FOR RECOVERY PURPOSES IN CASE THE      *
001400*D    RELEASE CREATE PROGRAM 'TRELBATC' BLOWS DOWN BEFORE    *
001500*D    PROCESSING THE 'RELFILE'.                              *
001600*                                                            *
001700**************************************************************
      *C
      *C  09/11/1996    CA YODER
      *C    MODIFIED PROGRAM FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C  10/27/1997        CA YODER
      *C    ADDED NOTIFY USER-ID FROM DSHIPREL TO THE LOGIC TO RECOVER
      *C    RECORDS.
001800
001900
002000
002100 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002200 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002300 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
002400 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
002500
002600 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
002700 FILE-CONTROL.
002800     SELECT REL-FILE ASSIGN TO DISK-RELFILE.
002900
           SELECT DSHIPREL-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2901
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

003000
003100 DATA DIVISION.
003200 FILE SECTION.
003300
003400 FD  REL-FILE
003500     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
003600     RECORD CONTAINS 106 CHARACTERS.
003700 01  REL-RCD.
003800     05  REL-BLANKET-NO        PIC X(7).
003900     05  REL-ITEM-NO           PIC 9(4).
004000     05  REL-ITEM-SEQ-NO       PIC 9(2).
004100     05  REL-CORP-CODE         PIC X(7).
004200     05  REL-LINE-DATA.
004300         10  REL-QUANTITY      PIC S9(8)V9(4).
004400         10  REL-SHIP-DATE     PIC X(6).
004500         10  REL-SUBD          PIC X(4).
004600         10  REL-ADDTL-DATA    PIC X(6).
004700         10  REL-TAX-CODE      PIC X(2).
004800         10  REL-STD-INST OCCURS 3 TIMES PIC X(3).
004900         10  REL-REQ-NO        PIC X(12).
005000         10  REL-SUB           PIC X(3).
005100         10  REL-EXPECT-DATE   PIC X(6).
005200         10  FILLER            PIC X(10).
           05  REL-CHAT-NO           PIC X(6).
           05  REL-NOTIFY-USERID     PIC X(10).
005300
       FD  DSHIPREL-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DSHIPREL-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS  OF MCFLCS2901.

005400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
005500 77  PROCEED-SW                   PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
005600 77  RCD-CTR                      PIC 9(4)  VALUE ZEROS.
005700
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".
005800
005900**************************************************************
006000**************************************************************
006100**                                                          **
006200**                DATABASE I/O BUFFER AREA                  **
006300**                                                          **
006400**************************************************************
006500**************************************************************
006600
006700 COPY DSHIPREL IN COPYLIB.
006800
007100*********************
007200*                   *
007300*   DATA SET NAMES  *
007400*                   *
007500*********************
007600
007700 01  DSET-NAMES.
007900     05  DSET-DSHIPREL          PIC X(16)  VALUE "DSHIPREL;".
008000
008200 COPY DATAB IN COPYLIB.
008700
008800**************************************************
008900**                DATE AREAS                    **
009000**************************************************
009100
009200 01  DATES-AND-TIMES.
009300     05  HP-CUR-DATE.
009400         10  MM               PIC XX.
009500         10  FILLER           PIC X.
009600         10  DD               PIC XX.
009700         10  FILLER           PIC X.
009800         10  YY               PIC XX.
           05  CUR-DATE-CN.
               10  CUR-CC           PIC XX.
009900         10  CUR-DATE.
010000             15  CUR-YY       PIC XX.
010100             15  CUR-MM       PIC XX.
010200             15  CUR-DD       PIC XX.
010300
010400 COPY TDATECHK IN COPYLIB.
010600
010700 COPY TBLOWUP IN COPYLIB.
011200
011300 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
011400
011500 PROC-DIV SECTION 01.
011600
011700
011800 1-BEGIN.
011900     PERFORM 1-HSK THRU 1-H-X.
012000
012100     PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-M-X.
012200
012300     PERFORM 2-EOJ  THRU 2-EOJ-X.
012400
012500     GOBACK.
012600
012700
012800
012900 1-HSK.
           OPEN I-O DSHIPREL-O.
013400
013500     MOVE 1                    TO  DATE-MODE.
013600     CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
013700     MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT         TO  CUR-DATE.
      *---------- ACCOUNT FOR CENTURY.
           IF CUR-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19"             TO  CUR-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE "20"             TO  CUR-CC.
013800
013900 1-H-X.
014000     EXIT.
014100
014200
014300 2-EOJ.
           CLOSE DSHIPREL-O.
014800
014900 2-EOJ-X.
015000     EXIT.
015100
015200*********************************************
015300*                                           *
015400*  BLOWUP ROUTINE EXECUTES WHENEVER A       *
015500*  FATAL ERROR OCCURS                       *
015600*                                           *
015700*********************************************
015800
015900 2-BLOWUP.
016000     MOVE  "TRELRCVR"     TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
016100     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
016200         DUMMY-VIEW-AREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
016300                 BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
016400
016500 2-BLOWUP-X.
016600     EXIT.
016700
016800
016900**************************************************
017000*                                                *
017100*     6 - M A I N                                *
017200*                                                *
017300**************************************************
017400
017500
017600 6-MAIN.
017700     DISPLAY "THE FILE USED AS INPUT IS 'RELFILE'.  IF THIS".
017800     DISPLAY "IS NOT THE DESIRED FILE YOU MUST ENTER A".
           DISPLAY "OVERRIDE DATA BASE FILE 'OVRDBF'".
017900     DISPLAY "STATEMENT BEFORE RUNNING THIS PROGRAM!!!".
018000     DISPLAY "  ".
018100     DISPLAY "FOR MORE INFORMATION ON THE SHIPPING RELEASE"
018200     DISPLAY "RECOVERY PROCESS REFER TO THE".
018300     DISPLAY "DOCUMENT - 'DRELRCVR'.".
018400     DISPLAY "  ".
018500     DISPLAY "  ".
018600     DISPLAY "OK TO PROCEED 'N/Y'?".
018700     ACCEPT  PROCEED-SW.
018800     DISPLAY "  ".
018900     IF PROCEED-SW = "Y"
019000         DISPLAY "*** STARTING RECOVERY!!! ***"
019100     ELSE
019200         DISPLAY "*** NO PROCESSING DONE!!! ***"
019300         GO TO 6-M-X.
019400
019500     OPEN INPUT REL-FILE.
019600     PERFORM 61-READ-SHIPREL  THRU  61-RS-X.
019700     CLOSE REL-FILE.
019800     DISPLAY "*** RECOVERY COMPLETE !!! ***".
019900     DISPLAY RCD-CTR,
020000      " ENTRIES WERE PLACED BACK INTO - 'DSHIPREL'."             .
020100
020200 6-M-X.
020300    EXIT.
020400
020500
020600 61-READ-SHIPREL.
021400     READ REL-FILE AT END
021500         GO TO 61-RS-X.
021600
021700     MOVE SPACES                  TO  BUF-DSHIPREL.
      *--------- ACCOUNT FOR CENTURY.
021800     MOVE CUR-DATE-CN             TO  DREL-DATE-CN.
021900     MOVE REL-CORP-CODE           TO  DREL-DSHIPREL-CODE.
022000     MOVE REL-BLANKET-NO          TO  DREL-NUMBER.
022100     MOVE REL-ITEM-NO             TO  DREL-ITEM-NO.
022200     MOVE REL-ITEM-SEQ-NO         TO  DREL-SEQ-NO.
022300     MOVE REL-LINE-DATA           TO  DREL-LINE-DATA.
           MOVE REL-CHAT-NO             TO  DREL-CHAT-NO.
           MOVE REL-NOTIFY-USERID       TO  DREL-NOTIFY-USERID.

           WRITE DSHIPREL-REC-O FROM BUF-DSHIPREL
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
022700         MOVE "PUT DSHIPREL*61-GD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
022800         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
022900     ADD 1                        TO  RCD-CTR.
023000
023100     GO TO 61-READ-SHIPREL.
023200
024000 61-RS-X.
024100     EXIT.
